sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 91.9/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) remediated evaluation of `2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py` (consensus score 92.0/100, up from 51.5/100 in Pass 1). The remediated script couples Stage-1 2D Meinhardt wing-compartment vein-boundary reaction-diffusion focus determination (`solve_stage1_vein_focus_rd`, isolating the organizer focus on the compartment midline `y_f = 0.0000 mm`, Nijhout 1990) to Stage-2 2D focal morphogen decay and concentric *Spalt* / *Engrailed* / *Distal-less* threshold induction across Wet-Season Wild-Type (`c0 = 1.00`), Dry-Season Ecdysone Polyphenism (`c0 = 0.42`, invariant gold annulus `Delta_R = 0.2648 mm`), *Goldeneye* Spalt-threshold shift (`theta_black = 0.44`, `Delta_R = 0.6941 mm`), Twin-Focus Hourglass Fusion (`d_12 = 1.50 mm`, bridge overlap `0.6765 mm`), and Early Pupal Focal Microcautery Ablation (`c0 = 0.05 -> R_gold = 0`, 6-point timing series `r = 1.0000`), and performs CV DoG focus detection and azimuthal radial luminance/chroma ring segmentation on the SHA-256-locked *Bicyclus anynana* ventral wing specimen photograph (`R_black / R_gold = 0.7569`), backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems. Overall 91.9/100 (faithfulness 91.8, reproducibility 92.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings_comparison.png: rendered output of 2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py at HEAD, image/png, 505778 B, 2237×1424 px, artifact_sha256 119a30775931cd53ef1c9f5786f4615c696be3390eba9beb4cbe252fb548b4b8 (sha256 119a30775931cd53ef1c9f5786f4615c696be3390eba9beb4cbe252fb548b4b8), spec_fingerprint 0a2086f2436043ce9998603ef36e23feb6c621834d7d960a99310b296156772b. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 0a2086f2436043ce9998603ef36e23feb6c621834d7d960a99310b296156772b; artifact_sha256: 119a30775931cd53ef1c9f5786f4615c696be3390eba9beb4cbe252fb548b4b8; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/bicyclus_anynana_eyespot_specimen.jpg=f1826cee44602782..., datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings_reference.json=b19590626bdaff79..., datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/scout_manifest.json=7cfe9d2221ea5b8b...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple Stage-1 focus reaction-diffusion directly to curved wing-margin parafocal element (chevron) formation across all 7 hindwing compartments simultaneously (Nijhout 1990, 2017).",
            "remediation needed: Incorporate explicit temperature-dependent 20-hydroxyecdysone (20E) receptor kinetics during the wandering-to-pupal transition window." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.919"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Pass 2 remediated assessment)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

